#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:4
msgid "v5.1.0"
msgstr "v5.1.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.1.0 is a feature release. The pane under the frame buffer grows from a "
"histogram into a set of **live views** -- Board Info, Memory, Statistics, "
"and the new **Channels** view that turns the values a script publishes into "
"widgets, graphs, spectra, and depth maps and records them to files -- the "
"frame buffer gets a **source selector** for multi-sensor cameras, the IDE "
"learns to load **third-party repositories** of boards, firmware, examples, "
"models, and stubs, and video recordings switch to H.264. New boards and "
"sensors are supported, the firmware tooling was hardened by a full audit of "
"every change since v5.0.0, and a handful of behaviours were brought over "
"from OpenMV Studio. It is built on Qt Creator 14.0.2 and bundles firmware "
"v5.0.1."
msgstr ""
"v5.1.0 adalah rilis fitur. Panel di bawah frame buffer tumbuh dari sekadar "
"histogram menjadi sekumpulan **tampilan langsung** -- Info Papan, Memori, "
"Statistik, dan tampilan **Kanal** yang baru yang mengubah nilai yang "
"dipublikasikan skrip menjadi widget, grafik, spektrum, dan peta kedalaman "
"serta merekamnya ke file -- frame buffer mendapat **pemilih sumber** untuk "
"kamera multi-sensor, IDE belajar memuat **repositori pihak ketiga** berisi "
"papan, firmware, contoh, model, dan stub, dan rekaman video beralih ke "
"H.264. Papan dan sensor baru didukung, perkakas firmware diperkuat melalui "
"audit menyeluruh atas setiap perubahan sejak v5.0.0, dan sejumlah perilaku "
"dibawa dari OpenMV Studio. Dibangun di atas Qt Creator 14.0.2 dan "
"menyertakan firmware v5.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:20
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:23
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Pane views** -- the histogram pane's title bar gains a selector that "
"switches the pane between the **Histogram**, **Board Info** (the connected "
"camera's hardware, versions, and capabilities), **Memory** (live graphs of "
"the MicroPython heap and every UMA pool, with peak tracking), **Statistics**"
" (the debug protocol's packet, error, and per-channel event counters), and "
"**Channels** views."
msgstr ""
"**Tampilan panel** -- bilah judul panel histogram mendapat pemilih yang "
"mengalihkan panel di antara tampilan **Histogram**, **Info Papan** "
"(perangkat keras, versi, dan kemampuan kamera yang terhubung), **Memori** "
"(grafik langsung heap MicroPython dan setiap pool UMA, dengan pelacakan "
"puncak), **Statistik** (penghitung paket, kesalahan, dan peristiwa per kanal"
" dari protokol debug), dan **Kanal**."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Channels view** -- a script can publish named channels of data and "
"controls over the debug protocol, and the IDE renders them live: labels, "
"toggles, sliders, spin boxes, radio buttons, line edits, selectors, push "
"buttons, and text blocks that write back to the camera; waveform graphs with"
" pan, zoom, markers, triggers, history, and a spectrum analyzer; and depth "
"maps with the camera's own palettes, three scaling filters, and tone "
"mapping. Any graph or map records to CSV, WAV, NumPy, or Edge Impulse JSON "
"and CBOR files -- including a Record All for a whole channel -- for training"
" data collection. The last values stay on screen when a script stops."
msgstr ""
"**Tampilan Kanal** -- sebuah skrip dapat memublikasikan kanal bernama berisi"
" data dan kontrol melalui protokol debug, dan IDE menampilkannya secara "
"langsung: label, toggle, slider, spin box, tombol radio, line edit, pemilih,"
" tombol tekan, dan blok teks yang menulis kembali ke kamera; grafik bentuk "
"gelombang dengan geser, zoom, penanda, pemicu, riwayat, dan penganalisis "
"spektrum; serta peta kedalaman dengan palet milik kamera sendiri, tiga "
"filter penskalaan, dan pemetaan tona. Grafik atau peta apa pun dapat direkam"
" ke file CSV, WAV, NumPy, atau JSON dan CBOR Edge Impulse -- termasuk Rekam "
"Semua untuk seluruh kanal -- untuk pengumpulan data pelatihan. Nilai "
"terakhir tetap di layar saat skrip berhenti."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Frame buffer source selector** -- cameras with more than one image sensor "
"show a selector in the frame buffer's title bar to choose which sensor "
"streams to the IDE (or to turn streaming off), the JPG toggle became a JPG /"
" RAW streaming-mode selector, and the pane's title names the format each "
"frame arrived in."
msgstr ""
"**Pemilih sumber frame buffer** -- kamera dengan lebih dari satu sensor "
"citra menampilkan pemilih di bilah judul frame buffer untuk memilih sensor "
"mana yang di-streaming ke IDE (atau untuk mematikan streaming), toggle JPG "
"menjadi pemilih mode streaming JPG / RAW, dan judul panel menyebutkan format"
" kedatangan setiap frame."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Third-party repositories** -- a vendor can publish a repository of boards,"
" firmware (release and development channels), examples, machine-learning "
"models, and ``.pyi`` stubs; the IDE installs it from a URL or from a folder "
"an installer dropped in, merges it with its own content, keeps it updated, "
"and lets you order vendors by priority. Managed from Preferences → OpenMV → "
"Third Party Repositories."
msgstr ""
"**Repositori pihak ketiga** -- vendor dapat menerbitkan repositori berisi "
"papan, firmware (saluran rilis dan pengembangan), contoh, model pembelajaran"
" mesin, dan stub ``.pyi``; IDE memasangnya dari URL atau dari folder yang "
"diletakkan oleh sebuah pemasang, menggabungkannya dengan konten miliknya "
"sendiri, menjaganya tetap diperbarui, dan memungkinkan Anda mengurutkan "
"vendor berdasarkan prioritas. Dikelola dari Preferensi → OpenMV → Repositori"
" Pihak Ketiga."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:51
msgid ""
"**New hardware** -- the OpenMV N6 Classic board (including its bootloader "
"driver, udev rule, and ROM-DFU recovery entry) and the FLIR Lepton 3.1R and "
"UW sensors."
msgstr ""
"**Perangkat keras baru** -- papan OpenMV N6 Classic (termasuk driver "
"bootloader, aturan udev, dan entri pemulihan ROM-DFU-nya) serta sensor FLIR "
"Lepton 3.1R dan UW."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:54
msgid ""
"**H.264 recordings** -- the frame buffer recorder and the video converter "
"now encode H.264 instead of MPEG-4 Part 2, with a pinned key-frame interval "
"so recordings seek cleanly and the frame rate snapped to a whole number."
msgstr ""
"**Rekaman H.264** -- perekam frame buffer dan pengonversi video kini "
"mengenkode H.264 alih-alih MPEG-4 Part 2, dengan interval key-frame yang "
"ditetapkan sehingga rekaman dapat dicari dengan bersih dan laju frame "
"dibulatkan ke bilangan bulat."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Audit fixes** -- every commit since v5.0.0 was reviewed twice for "
"regressions, with particular attention to the firmware, bootloader, and "
"ROMFS paths; the defects found are fixed in this release (see :ref:`bug "
"fixes <v5_1_0_bug_fixes>`)."
msgstr ""
"**Perbaikan audit** -- setiap komit sejak v5.0.0 ditinjau dua kali untuk "
"mencari regresi, dengan perhatian khusus pada jalur firmware, bootloader, "
"dan ROMFS; cacat yang ditemukan diperbaiki dalam rilis ini (lihat "
":ref:`perbaikan bug <v5_1_0_bug_fixes>`)."

