"**Pemilih sumber frame buffer dan pembacaan format** -- pilih sensor yang "
"di-streaming pada kamera multi-sensor, atau Off; format frame yang diterima "
"ditampilkan di judul panel; toggle JPG kini menjadi pemilih JPG Mode / RAW "
"Mode (`e76284bde9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e76284bde9e>`__, `c2baff8d60c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c2baff8d60c>`__, `afece31cb6a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/afece31cb6a>`__, `76448d7b9dd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/76448d7b9dd>`__)."

